---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — PoolSavr"
  description="The terms that govern your use of PoolSavr."
>
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-navy-400">
          This is placeholder copy and is not legal advice. Replace it with terms
          reviewed by your counsel before launch.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-navy-600">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl">Using the service</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">
              PoolSavr provides property measurement estimates derived from aerial
              and satellite imagery. You agree to submit addresses you have a
              legitimate business reason to measure.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl">Estimates, not surveys</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">
              Measurements are estimates produced from imagery and are not a
              substitute for a licensed land survey. You are responsible for
              verifying figures before relying on them in a binding contract.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl">Accounts and billing</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">
              Paid plans renew on the cadence selected at signup until cancelled.
              Measurements we cannot complete are not counted against your plan
              allowance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl">Limitation of liability</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">
              To the fullest extent permitted by law, PoolSavr is not liable for
              indirect or consequential damages arising from use of the service or
              reliance on measurement estimates.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl">Contact</h2>
            <p class="mt-3">
              Questions about these terms? Email
              <a href="mailto:hello@poolsavr.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">
                hello@poolsavr.com
              </a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
